{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2021-04-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'MASN AND NBC REGIONAL SPORTS NETWORKS REMOVED FROM DISH TV, SLING TV', 'text': 'ENGLEWOOD, COLO., APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0\xa0MASN AND NBC REGIONAL SPORTS NETWORKS (RSNS) WERE REMOVED FROM DISH TV AND SLING TV LAST NIGHT, AFFECTING ACCESS IN 10 STATES AND WASHINGTON D.C.'}